  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ea/step-3b957c00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ea/step-232a9410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice capsicum. Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook capsicum, stirring, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add Asian greens and cook until just wilted, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add the soy sauce, tossing to coat. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ea/step-957fc820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine the mayonnaise and Japanese style dressing.\n• Divide the garlic rice between bowls, then top with crumbed chick'n and veggies.\n• Serve with a dollop of Japanese mayo and a sprinkle of mixed sesame seeds. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ea/step-c05e1730.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
